# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``n_batches = 1``: Number of batches of configurations used by the different calls to the eigenstate solver\n"
msgstr "``n_batches = 1``: Anzahl der Batches von Konfigurationen, die von den verschiedenen Aufrufen des Eigenzustands-Solvers verwendet werden\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``samples_per_batch = 2``: Number of unique configurations to include in each batch\n"
msgstr "``samples_per_batch = 2``: Anzahl der eindeutigen Konfigurationen, die in jeden Batch aufgenommen werden\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtain decimal representation of the spin-up and spin-down bitstrings used by the eigenstate solver.\n"
msgstr "Die Dezimaldarstellung der vom Eigenzustands-Solver verwendeten Spin-up- und Spin-down-Bitstrings ermitteln.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first element in the tuple corresponds to the decimal representation of the spin-up configurations, while the second element in the tuple corresponds to the decimal representation of the spin-down configurations:\n"
msgstr "Das erste Element des Tupels entspricht der Dezimaldarstellung der Spin-up-Konfigurationen, das zweite Element des Tupels der Dezimaldarstellung der Spin-down-Konfigurationen:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that while the number of samples per batch is two, and the sampled bitstrings are: $00010010$ and $01001000$, four electronic configurations are generated per spin-species. In this case, the set of unique spin-polarized configurations is given by:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\{ 0001, 0010, 0100, 1000 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"whose base-10 decimal representation is\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_{10} = \\{ 1, 2, 4, 8 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"Basis of the subspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Beachte: Obwohl die Anzahl der Samples pro Batch zwei beträgt und die gesampelten Bitstrings $00010010$ und $01001000$ lauten, werden pro Spinsorte vier elektronische Konfigurationen erzeugt. In diesem Fall ist die Menge der eindeutigen spinpolarisierten Konfigurationen gegeben durch:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\{ 0001, 0010, 0100, 1000 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"deren Dezimaldarstellung zur Basis 10 lautet\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_{10} = \\{ 1, 2, 4, 8 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"Basis des Unterraums:\n"

